v 3
d ctoclient: Stata client for the SurveyCTO API
d
d Downloads data from a SurveyCTO server into Stata through the SurveyCTO
d REST API. Stata companion of the R package ctoclient.
d
d The JSON parser is written in Mata, which makes ctoclient very fast,
d memory-efficient and robust: it uses vectorised Mata operations instead of
d Stata loops, reads the file in 8 MB pieces so memory use stays low for
d large downloads, and keeps text in any language exactly as sent.
d
d cto_form_data            download the submissions of a form (wide JSON),
d                          parse them in Mata and load them into Stata;
d                          converts SurveyCTO date-times to %tc and checks KEY.
d cto_form_data_attachment download the submissions and their media files
d                          (images, audio, text audits, ...); only files not
d                          yet in the media folder are downloaded.
d
d Supports encrypted forms (private key) and incremental downloads by date.
d
d Requires: Stata 15 or newer, and curl (included in Windows 10 version 1803
d and later, macOS and most Linux distributions).
d
d KW: SurveyCTO
d KW: survey data
d KW: API
d KW: JSON
d KW: media
d KW: data import
d
d Author: Gutama Girja Urago, Laterite
d Support: email gurago@laterite.com
d
d Distribution-Date: 20260924
d
f ctoclient.sthlp
f cto_form_data.ado
f cto_form_data.sthlp
f cto_form_data_attachment.ado
f cto_form_data_attachment.sthlp
